{"title": "High Spellcasting (+2)", "pageid": 28194, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/High_Spellcasting_(+2)", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/High_Spellcasting_(%2B1)\" title=\"High Spellcasting (+1)\">High Spellcasting (+1)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>High Spellcasting</b> is a passive feature that makes the wearers spells more potent and difficult to defend against.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain a +2 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Save_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Save DC\">Spell Save DC</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amulet_of_the_Devout\" title=\"Amulet of the Devout\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png\"